{"version":1,"content":"<p>緣分要嚟嘅話，真係擋都擋唔住，隨時會有艷遇降臨一啲都唔出奇！</p><p>AV業界資深人士神仙乙百分之百認同，仲話喺AV世界入面見過唔少萍水相逢嘅男女一拍即合，轉個頭已經喺床上翻雲覆雨，真係快過打針！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;大送秋波&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.417476+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T14:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T18:59:04.608615+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"3253108d6e2cc77730afffcf703de5ce91424193cc29aa96c7b2e0881f51a9da","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}